OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Wolves manager takes on club
OL,4,Aabseil challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Wolverhampton Wanderers manager
OL,7,FMick McCarthy will abseil down the
OL,8,FMolineux Stadium to raise money for the
OL,9,Fclub's official charity.
OL,11,FHe will join broadcaster Suzi Perry, an
OL,12,Fambassador for the Wolves Foundation,
OL,13,Ffor the annual event which takes place
OL,14,Fon Saturday.
OL,16,FParticipants will climb to the top of
OL,17,Fthe Billy Wright Stand and abseil down
OL,18,Fto the pitch.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
